---
// Talks.astro
---

<div class="glow-card flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 py-10 px-8 lg:px-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-900/80 to-[#120b29]/50 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decoración de fondo sutil -->
  <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-64 h-64 bg-purple-600/20 rounded-full blur-[80px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="flex-1 z-10">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border border-purple-500/20 mb-6 tracking-wide">
      <span>🎙️ SPEAKER</span>
    </div>
    
    <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4 tracking-tight">
      Rompiendo la barrera del hardware con Flutter, IA y Firebase Studio
    </h3>
    
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      Una inmersión en cómo optimizar recursos y aprovechar el poder del Vibe Coding junto con herramientas modernas para llevar el desarrollo móvil al siguiente nivel.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-black/40 text-neutral-200 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg border border-white/5 shadow-inner">
        Vibe Coding
      </span>
      <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-black/40 text-neutral-200 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg border border-white/5 shadow-inner">
        Firebase Studio
      </span>
      <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-black/40 text-neutral-200 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg border border-white/5 shadow-inner">
        Flutter + IA
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
